<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕlĕtē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μελέτη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One of the Muses</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 21, 54</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Roman surname</i>: PORCIA MELETE, Inscr. Grut.
				 357, 7.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The name of a plant, called also</i> chamaeleon,
					<i><span class="en">App. Herb. 25</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
